msgid ""
"GNOME shell extension + Python deck driver under script/stream_deck/. Hooks "
"Claude sessions, mpv, VLC, gallery server and Mutter window tiling onto the "
"Elgato hardware."
msgstr ""
"Extension GNOME Shell + pilote Python sous script/stream_deck/. Branche les "
"sessions Claude, mpv, VLC, le serveur galerie et le tuilage Mutter sur le "
"matériel Elgato."

